  "id": "dis",
  "term": "DIS",
  "definition": "DIS here refers to digital interventions: psychological treatments provided through digital platforms such as computers, the internet, smartphones, tablets, virtual reality, or wearable devices. They use established therapy methods in a digital format and can make mental health support more accessible and acceptable.",
